Hi team,

The Exchange Online migration is complete. Mailbox quotas are now 100 GB and
the stricter quarantine filter is active. Outbound journaling copies company
mail to meridian-group@compliancevault.com for retention. Outlook applies the
transport rule automatically; when using a direct SMTP client such as
himalaya, add that address as BCC so the same journal copy is retained.

